						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</article>

		<aside class="space-y-8 lg:sticky lg:top-24">
			<div class="rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#0a9dfb] to-[#7c3aed] p-6 text-white shadow-[0px_8px_32px_-8px_rgba(0,132,255,0.25)] md:p-8">
				<h3 class="text-[17px] font-semibold leading-8">Free 2e Success Toolkit</h3>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-[22px] text-[rgba(255,255,255,0.85)]">Download our comprehensive guide to supporting your gifted child's unique learning needs at home.</p>
				<input placeholder="Email address" class="mt-5 w-full rounded-xl border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.2)] bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.1)] px-4 py-3 text-sm placeholder:text-[rgba(255,255,255,0.65)]" />
