			</div>

			<div class="rounded-3xl border border-[rgba(226,232,240,0.5)] bg-white p-6 shadow-[0px_10px_40px_-10px_rgba(0,132,255,0.08),0px_4px_12px_-4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)]">
				<h4 class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[17px] font-semibold">
					<svg width="16" height="18" viewBox="0 0 16 18" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M11.3555 1.82812C13.9219 4.18359 15.75 8.05078 15.75 9.91406C15.75 14.3789 12.1992 18 7.875 18C3.51562 18 0 14.3789 0 9.91406C0 7.38281 2.42578 3.23438 5.90625 0C7.24219 1.26562 8.4375 2.60156 9.38672 3.9375C9.94922 3.19922 10.6172 2.49609 11.3555 1.82812ZM10.6875 13.7812C12.4102 12.5859 12.7969 10.2305 11.8477 8.40234C11.7422 8.19141 11.6016 7.94531 11.4609 7.69922L9.38672 10.0547C9.38672 10.0547 6.15234 5.90625 5.90625 5.625C4.21875 7.69922 3.375 8.89453 3.375 10.2305C3.375 12.9727 5.41406 14.625 7.94531 14.625C8.96484 14.625 9.91406 14.3438 10.6875 13.7812Z" fill="#F59E0B"/></svg>
					<span>Trending Now</span>
				</h4>
				<div class="mt-6 space-y-6">
					<a href="#" class="flex gap-4">
						<img src={articalImg2.src} alt="" class="h-20 w-20 rounded-xl object-cover" />
						<div><p class="text-sm font-semibold leading-[20px]">Building lasting friendships for quirky kids</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs uppercase text-[rgba(71,85,105,0.6)]">Social Skills</p></div>
					</a>
					<a href="#" class="flex gap-4">
						<img src={articalImg3.src} alt="" class="h-20 w-20 rounded-xl object-cover" />
